From a3ea0ae6fe9d8c424f7d8447a66320b4188d1ec6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 17:46:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LEGO City: LB held opens the game's Disguise Selector; RB tap
 Scan, held wheel

LB held holds the disguise icon until the selector opens (+0x472), the
right stick moves between its portraits (drawn with the map cursor),
letting go taps the one chosen, and a locked pick or none closes it.
The button wheel moves to RB held; RB tapped is Scan. The bottom screen
shows whole while the selector is open.
